<title>USA: Sauk Rapids, Minn., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Sauk Rapids, Minn., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $1.080 million of Sauk Rapids, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.91 percent.</p>
</text>
